Description:
Ipcz is the IPC routing and data transfer library integrated into Mojo Core
(//mojo/core). Historically, the library supported standalone build and was
placed in //third_party/ipcz. Currently it depends directly on //base. Changes
go through the standard Chromium code review process.

See README.md for an overview of ipcz.

